WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.740
What?

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:58.600
You can no longer bear my wounds?

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:05.270
Thank you for everything,

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.300
demon god...

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:56.030
<b><i>The Demon Revives</i></b>

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.290
I shall aid you.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:17.550
Now, the only choice is to force 
them to shed their blood.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:19.890
You're...

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.680
Then, you have come to your senses, Hibiki?

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:51.960
Joujin-sama, I shall handle them!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.440
Wait!

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.650
Have you forgotten your wounds?

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.700
You are seriously injured.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.940
Hachirou... Hibiki.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:10.220
I am afraid I shall have to spill your blood

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.950
upon the corpse of the great demon king!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.780
It hurts...

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.840
Hey, we've done enough, right?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.880
It's so cold.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:49.260
I see... I must've lost too much blood.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:54.020
It was cold back then, too...

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.120
This picture's wonderful...

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:04.750
It makes me feel like I can use many 
more types of hallucinations,

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.120
since you gave it to me.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.280
It makes me happy that you like it.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:21.300
All I remember is taking baths with you...

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.310
See?

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.820
It's like red lipstick.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:58.130
Hadaebou, why are you helping us?

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.960
So you can tell the shogun?

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:04.160
To see the ending of this.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.630
To see the answer, the young ninjas,

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.340
and you young leaders, give...

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.350
To see its ending.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:20.480
What will happen to us ninjas?

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.310
Come and get me, Hachirou.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:41.630
Aren't you ashamed that you can 
rely on no power but your eyes?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.630
There's no reason to be ashamed 
of the techniques I've inherited.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:48.830
Ignorant, blind, and unwilling to learn.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:52.010
My heart is like a calm sea.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.890
Your eyes have no power over me!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.500
A calm sea...

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.640
Then, I shall make it storm and rage!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:10.440
Die!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.000
Hadaebou!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.700
Hachirou!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.460
Farewell, Kouga Hachirou.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:22.520
What's going... on?!

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:28.860
<i>Ninja Technique... Butterfly!</i>

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.610
This won't stop me!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:42.120
<i>Ninja Technique: Dreaming Reality...</i>

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.620
You think hallucinations will work?

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.380
Nonsense!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:06.650
How dare you... How dare you 
shame me in such a way?

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:18.510
This is the technique you gave me.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.160
Have you felt its power?!

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.660
Joujin-sama...

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.420
Joujin-sama!

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.870
Maybe now...

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.910
I can show it to you...

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:52.070
Joujin-sama, I'll handle this!

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:54.130
Know your master.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:57.880
Get back, Kujaku.

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.400
Fool!

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.740
Move, Hachirou.

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:31.170
I'll show you that her techniques 
will never work on me again.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.210
He honored me...

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:40.920
He honored me... far too highly... 
by calling me simply "Kujaku."

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.430
My master!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:06.200
Kujaku, what are you doing?

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.830
Shut up and just die already!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:16.840
What is this?

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:20.110
Kujaku...

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.900
Kujaku?

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:25.590
Each time you call me that, it sickens me!

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:30.810
"Know your master." Isn't that what you said?

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:33.050
That's right!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:36.480
I'm... I'm doing this for my master!

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:42.770
The one who called me "Kujaku"...

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:59.000
<b>
Tenth Year of the Tenshou Era, 1582 AD 

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:59.000
<b>
Honnouji</b>

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:15.520
Ranmaru.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:16.770
Yes, sir!

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:22.750
What did you think of that demonic voice just now?

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:25.780
I'm sorry to tell you this, master,

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.120
but your obsession with conquest

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:33.590
is difficult for the simple-minded to understand.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:36.820
And so, they call you...

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.970
Demon King of the Sixth Heaven?

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:40.780
Yes, sir.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:42.300
Very well.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.300
And?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:51.310
You have spread the flames of conquest 
across the land, like a demon.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:55.240
So it is possible that a demon itself...

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:59.310
has taken an interest.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:04.660
No... There's no other possibility at all!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.110
You're a clever one.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:13.090
Help me commit seppuku, then, Ranmaru.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.320
I shall follow you soon!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.330
No.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.090
Master, what do you mean?

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:25.140
Remember what I told everyone?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.830
I can take pride in three things.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:33.280
First, my white-spotted hawk. 
Second, my pale bird.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:37.500
And third, Ranmaru. You.

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.830
You honor me too much, sir!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:45.910
If you were a bird, you would
be a peacock, which we call "kujaku"...

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.610
Yes, a kujaku.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.480
I know not when I shall return.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:55.400
But while you yet live,

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.880
will you keep your brilliant wings spread?

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:04.690
So that the embers of my conquest 
might not go out?

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.130
Yes, sir!

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:46.670
Well done, young warrior.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.170
Are you the demon?

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:57.560
If your words were a lie,

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:02.030
then I shall become a demon to surpass you,

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.940
and plunge you into the lowest hell.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:11.450
I am the servant of the Demon 
King of the Sixth Heaven...

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.800
Then, will you become a demon now?

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.120
What is your name?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:29.210
I am... Kujaku.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.470
Yes.

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:35.970
I am Kujaku...

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.470
I no longer need that name!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:42.320
I am Ranmaru.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:46.570
And the master who called me that,

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:50.370
Nobunaga-sama, will now revive!

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:53.490
I knew it.

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:58.110
<i>Fifty years of a man's life</i>

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:03.810
<i>are like a dream,</i>

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:09.820
<i>compared to the heavens.</i>

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:14.770
<i>Once a man is born,</i>

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:21.930
<i>must he not die?</i>

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:29.770
I would expect no less
from you, Joujin-sama...

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:37.480
To think Kouga Hachirou and Iga 
Hibiki's blood was unnecessary.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.280
That your blood alone was enough!

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:47.540
Devouring a demon opens the path to conquest.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:56.510
My master shall devour the blood 
of a demon and return to life!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.560
Impossible.

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:46.810
At last...

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:55.860
At last we meet, Lord Nobunaga.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:02.660
Now, make of this world a hell on earth.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.370
And bring about true salvation.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:12.480
Let us bring my— no, our, desire to fruition!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.890
Silence.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:31.980
So with true salvation upon us, 
there is no further need for me...

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.980
So profound...

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.290
My master... I, Ranmaru,

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:45.410
have awaited this moment for so long!

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.170
How ugly.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.930
Hachirou! Hibiki!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:03.430
We're getting out of here!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.860
Namenba?

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.180
This is the end!

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:11.690
What have you done?!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.260
Is that Nobunaga?

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.940
Doesn't he have a pretty face?

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:22.950
Maybe I'll ask him for some fun in hell!

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:04.740
The Inverted Halberd of Time?

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:15.960
I will protect my master!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:21.270
Disgusting monster...

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:27.650
with your ugly form, you would
try to trick me by claiming to be

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:30.760
the beautiful Ranmaru?

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:37.410
Fool.

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:43.410
You are nothing like Ranmaru, 
who was as beautiful

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:46.250
as the kujaku bird.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.960
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:27.740
Let us stop this.

00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:30.790
It's all over, Kujaku.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:34.470
Your backward-flowing corridor of time

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:37.470
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Scatter</i></b>

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:38.890
must be sealed within my Adamantite Tower.
